{"segs": ["PA_ja_79:0.4"], "en": "9. The Kharassara Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_79:1.1", "PA_ja_79:1.2"], "en": "“When the cattle have been plundered and slaughtered, the houses burnt down, and the people led away;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
